#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This collection of links defines a scenario in which a vehicle slowly backs out from between two parked vehicles, with blind-spot sensors that detect a crossing vehicle.
#
#Each sensor dataset includes a link to VS Commands and VS Visualizer HUD information, to show a blind-spot alert and set a braking command when an approaching moving vehicle is detected.
#
#VS Events are used to brake the vehicle when a command is non-zero.
